      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-yc-7" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-yc-7">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">¿Dónde nos vemos?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Todos los charters salen de Marina Cabo, Muelle F. Te enviaremos direcciones detalladas y un mapa después de reservar. <a href="/es/shuttle-service" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">Servicio de transporte</a> disponible desde cualquier hotel de Cabo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
